<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Licenses · mln-rs</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 16 16'%3E%3Cpath d='M8 1 11 8H5z' fill='%23d2392b'/%3E%3Cpath d='M8 15 5 8h6z' fill='%235d6874'/%3E%3C/svg%3E">
  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: light;
      --surface: #ffffff;
      --ink: #1d2733;
      --muted: #5d6874;
      --line: rgb(29 39 51 / 0.14);
      --code: rgb(29 39 51 / 0.04);
      --link: #2f6fd6;
    }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      :root {
        color-scheme: dark;
        --surface: #222a33;
        --ink: #e6eaee;
        --muted: #9ba6b1;
        --line: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.14);
        --code: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.04);
        --link: #7eaaf2;
      }
    }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--surface);
      color: var(--ink);
      font: 15px/1.5 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    }
    main {
      max-width: 52rem;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 24px 16px 48px;
    }
    a { color: var(--link); }
    h1 { font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 8px; }
    h2 { font-size: 18px; margin: 32px 0 8px; }
    h3 { font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 4px; }
    p, blockquote { margin: 0 0 12px; }
    blockquote { color: var(--muted); padding-left: 12px; border-left: 3px solid var(--line); }
    ul { padding-left: 20px; }
    .overview { columns: 14rem; }
    .license { list-style: none; margin: 0 0 24px; padding: 16px 0 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .licenses { padding: 0; }
    .used-by { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; margin: 0 0 8px; }
    .used-by a { color: inherit; }
    .note { font-size: 13px; margin: 0 0 8px; }
    pre {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 12px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      white-space: pre-wrap;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
      background: var(--code);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 6px;
      font: 12px/1.45 ui-monospace, "SF Mono", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <h1>Licenses</h1>
    <p>This page runs <a href="https://github.com/louwers/mln-rs">mln-rs</a> compiled to WebAssembly, together with the Rust crates below. mln-rs's own crates (<code>mln-rs-…</code>) are under its BSD 2-Clause License: <a href="./mln-rs-LICENSE.txt">its license</a>. The code they port from other projects keeps its license, listed below with the crates under each, and its text.</p>
    <p>The map's text rendering is based in part on the work of the FreeType Team:</p>
    <blockquote>Portions of this software are copyright © 2024 The FreeType Project (www.freetype.org). All rights reserved.</blockquote>
    <p>MapLibre GL JS, which the comparison loads, is under the BSD 3-Clause License: <a href="./maplibre-gl-LICENSE.txt">its license</a>. The map data, styles and fonts come from their providers, whom the map credits.</p>

    <h2>Overview</h2>
    <ul class="overview">
      {{#each overview}}
      <li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
      {{/each}}
    </ul>

    <h2>License texts</h2>
    <ul class="licenses">
      {{#each licenses}}
      <li class="license"{{#if first_of_kind}} id="{{id}}"{{/if}}>
        <h3>{{name}}</h3>
        <p class="used-by">Used by {{#each used_by}}{{#unless @first}}, {{/unless}}<a href="{{#if crate.repository}}{{crate.repository}}{{else}}https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}{{/if}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a>{{/each}}</p>
        {{#unless source_path}}
        <p class="note">These crates have no license file of their own: mln-rs's are under its license, linked above, and any other under this standard text of its license.</p>
        {{/unless}}
        <pre>{{text}}</pre>
      </li>
      {{/each}}
    </ul>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
